 to workday\", or \"workday doesn't do that, its a third party plugin.\"  They are never responsible and it is always someone else.  Well, they assign scores used in candidate rankings to people, and these are certainly tuned against right wing.  Despite they will vehemently deny the score is shared between companies, the score sticks to that person for ALL APPLICATIONS they make across the entire labor market.  Workday is used by 65% of the fortune 500.  Their goal is to derank right wing Americans and promote globalist foreigners.  DONALD TRUMP,  Please investigate and NAIL these fucking commie shitheads who are creating a labor epidemic in the United States and also working to destroy your jobs numbers.", "author": "one_cool", "created": 1790189250947, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "CleanUpPhillyTrump24", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "TRUMP, When will you investigate WORKDAY?  Leftist/globalists are using WORKDAY to blacklist workers across entire labor market.", "last_comment_created": 1790190126265, "content": "<p>They think they have bulletproof racket going.  Workday is hiding their blacklisting in AI models, one of which is called HiredRight made by israelis.  They assign their leftist social credit scores to people using these models.  because the &quot;brain&quot; of the models is just a bunch of numbers, no one can prove directly their criteria.  They use vague AI dogwhistles like &quot;evaluate applicant's career trajectory,&quot; which is essentially code to ask &quot;are they a leftist?&quot;  Additionally, they are building products that plug into workday and also do this same shit.  The major offender is eightfold.ai, made by indians and probably indian government.  They use tons of indirection saying &quot;no we just provide a score to workday&quot;, or &quot;workday doesn't do that, its a third party plugin.&quot;  They are never responsible and it is always someone else.  Well, they assign scores used in candidate rankings to people, and these are certainly tuned against right wing.  Despite they will vehemently deny the score is shared between companies, the score sticks to that person for ALL APPLICATIONS they make across the entire labor market.  Workday is used by 65% of the fortune 500.  Their goal is to derank right wing Americans and promote globalist foreigners.  DONALD TRUMP,  Please investigate and NAIL these fucking commie shitheads who are creating a labor epidemic in the United States and also working to destroy your jobs numbers.</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 3, "score_up": 15, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1ATVQp02CG", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 30, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8851920, "raw_content": "", "author": "Eruditio", "created": 1790175467447, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "RentedMule", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "www.thegatewaypundit.com", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "https://media.scored.co/preview/1ATVQp02CG.png", "removal_source": "", "link": "https://www.thegatewaypundit.com/2026/09/missouri-mom-who-killed-two-month-old-daughter/", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "Missouri Mom Who Killed Two